---
layout: base.njk
title: blog
schemaKind: collection
schemaItems: posts
description: "Writing by Abdullah Öğük on web development, design and photography. Web, tasarım ve fotoğraf üzerine yazılar."
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>{% icon "write" %}blog <span class="muted">/ yazılar</span></h1>
  <p class="muted">Notes on the web, design and making things. <a href="/feed.xml">rss</a></p>
</header>

{%- if collections.posts.length %}
<ol class="rows posts">
  {%- for post in collections.posts %}
  <li>
    <time class="muted" datetime="{{ post.date | ymd }}">{{ post.date | ymd }}</time>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
{%- else %}
<p class="muted">Nothing here yet. Henüz yazı yok.</p>
{%- endif %}
